            "Credit review unresolved",
            "Contracted space changed after client acceptance",
            "Expected headcount below the guaranteed minimum",
            "A contracted service cannot be staffed on the date",
            "Outside vendor insurance or licensing not on file",
            "Accessibility accommodation not yet confirmed",
            "Allergen or dietary requirement not yet confirmed"
